  },
  {
    "cluster": 1,
    "rank": 1,
    "unit_id": "Sb42503c567c1948611df",
    "text": "Lot of skill and build options too",
    "review_ids": [
      "237730350"
    ],
    "source_languages": [
      "english"
    ],
    "lexical_categories_diagnostic": [
      "gameplay"
    ],
    "cosine_to_center": 0.8171514272689819
  },
  {
    "cluster": 1,
    "rank": 2,
    "unit_id": "Sf7b3497d8457793dbde7",
    "text": "It adds another layer of complexity, forces you to think more tactically, make better use of every character's abilities, and really get the most out of your party",
    "review_ids": [
      "239007456"
    ],
    "source_languages": [
      "english"
    ],
    "lexical_categories_diagnostic": [
      "story_characters"
    ],
    "cosine_to_center": 0.8149962425231934
  },
  {
    "cluster": 1,
    "rank": 3,
    "unit_id": "S0c569b921f7e91bbb5b0",
    "text": "The play at your own pace, while you explore, catch, build, craft, grind, and level up gives you tons of options.",
    "review_ids": [
      "238772033"
    ],
    "source_languages": [
      "english"
    ],
    "lexical_categories_diagnostic": [
      "gameplay"
    ],
    "cosine_to_center": 0.8127518892288208
  },
  {
    "cluster": 1,
    "rank": 4,
    "unit_id": "S29e11adc5bda5057d3e5",
    "text": "It is a roguelike game, therefore, it gives you different experience on how the game should be played",
    "review_ids": [
      "238518491"
    ],
    "source_languages": [
      "english"
    ],
    "lexical_categories_diagnostic": [
      "gameplay"
    ],
    "cosine_to_center": 0.8038517832756042
  },
  {
    "cluster": 1,
    "rank": 5,
    "unit_id": "S1bd54b387ac5bb842a5b",
    "text": "you can try new killers and new builds to keep it fun",
    "review_ids": [
      "239100761"
    ],
    "source_languages": [
      "english"
    ],
    "lexical_categories_diagnostic": [
      "gameplay"
    ],
    "cosine_to_center": 0.8032062649726868
  },
  {
    "cluster": 1,
    "rank": 6,
    "unit_id": "S33a74216cce83f90dfea",
    "text": "Also there is a story to the game just have to look for it.",
    "review_ids": [
      "238877652"
    ],
    "source_languages": [
      "english"
    ],
    "lexical_categories_diagnostic": [
      "story_characters"
    ],
    "cosine_to_center": 0.7953256368637085
  },
  {
    "cluster": 1,
    "rank": 7,
    "unit_id": "S8fcbaf1cf79af4a132d5",
    "text": "the multiplayer needs more things added and th game can get quite a bit repeatitive,",
    "review_ids": [
      "238876350"
    ],
    "source_languages": [
      "english"
    ],
    "lexical_categories_diagnostic": [
      "multiplayer_community"
    ],
    "cosine_to_center": 0.7952015399932861
  },
  {
    "cluster": 1,
    "rank": 8,
    "unit_id": "Sf1eaee5713de8f655bf5",
    "text": "getting in the game and \"getting caught up\" to understanding how to play the current build is worth it",
    "review_ids": [
      "238976498"
    ],
    "source_languages": [
      "english"
    ],
    "lexical_categories_diagnostic": [
      "gameplay"
    ],
    "cosine_to_center": 0.794770359992981
  },
  {
    "cluster": 2,
    "rank": 1,
    "unit_id": "Sfaa60c30192255b02d7b",
    "text": "，仇恨也很远，不打死就一直跟着我，甚至有些跑得比我还快，死掉之后什么都要重新打一遍 难度高还不能自行调整难度，这对玩家充满恶意，不能给我带来快乐，对我来说就算不得好游戏",
    "review_ids": [
      "239006712"
    ],
    "source_languages": [
      "schinese"
    ],
    "lexical_categories_diagnostic": [
      "controls_difficulty"
    ],
    "cosine_to_center": 0.8682953119277954
  },
  {
    "cluster": 2,
    "rank": 2,
    "unit_id": "S090180cebc94896792fa",
    "text": "难度太大，不看攻略完全玩不了，没什么乐趣",
    "review_ids": [
      "238751382"
    ],
    "source_languages": [
      "schinese"
    ],
    "lexical_categories_diagnostic": [
      "controls_difficulty"
    ],
    "cosine_to_center": 0.8679039478302002
  },
  {
    "cluster": 2,
    "rank": 3,
    "unit_id": "Saed471942a53c558504e",
    "text": "缺点就是引导太差，内容太多，普通玩家需要搜攻略才能完美体验",
    "review_ids": [
      "238824346"
    ],
    "source_languages": [
      "schinese"
    ],
    "lexical_categories_diagnostic": [
      "content_support"
    ],
    "cosine_to_center": 0.8667120933532715
  },
  {
    "cluster": 2,
    "rank": 4,
    "unit_id": "S2bd542650d4348978015",
    "text": "基本就是个不停突突突的游戏，2代难度还特别变态，喜欢弄一大堆敌人来360度伏击，掩体都不给一个，不死个几百次别想通关，我还玩的正常难度都能体验到极致的挫败感，就算侥幸过了伏击点也没感到喜悦，因为后面还有一堆类似的场景等着，玩一会就让人特别疲惫，只适合精力旺盛喜欢挑战FPS技术的玩家",
    "review_ids": [
      "233642698"
    ],
    "source_languages": [
      "schinese"
    ],
    "lexical_categories_diagnostic": [
      "controls_difficulty"
    ],
    "cosine_to_center": 0.8605503439903259
  },
  {
    "cluster": 2,
    "rank": 5,
    "unit_id": "Sc55386bcd9a5af9684e6",
    "text": "剧情也非常逆天，看起来非常无聊，哦对了，它还有单机fps设计最垃圾的跟随角色，听角色讲废话，玩起来非常影响心流，玩得正爽呢，打完一个战点不求你搞个解密，起码别搞这种跟随吧",
    "review_ids": [
      "237630423"
    ],
    "source_languages": [
      "schinese"
    ],
    "lexical_categories_diagnostic": [
      "story_characters"
    ],
    "cosine_to_center": 0.8602674007415771
  },
  {
    "cluster": 2,
    "rank": 6,
    "unit_id": "S9df5e2ca95d1b76de9a2",
    "text": "牺牲流畅性，玩不了，牺牲画面感，像在看恐怖片，各个长得是千奇百怪不可直视",
    "review_ids": [
      "239023404"
    ],
    "source_languages": [
      "schinese"
    ],
    "lexical_categories_diagnostic": [
      "audiovisual"
    ],
    "cosine_to_center": 0.8588736653327942
  },
  {
    "cluster": 2,
    "rank": 7,
    "unit_id": "S6cad7384ddd0d3e09ead",
    "text": "但运气味重，进阶一开全逼你玩无限流，开局不成型就纯坐牢，画面也糙",
    "review_ids": [
      "238550659"
    ],
    "source_languages": [
      "schinese"
    ],
    "lexical_categories_diagnostic": [
      "audiovisual"
    ],
    "cosine_to_center": 0.8560464978218079
  },
  {
    "cluster": 2,
    "rank": 8,
    "unit_id": "S6d1907cfea0b3cd5a644",
    "text": "游戏挺好玩的，就是重复性太高了，前面玩着很好玩，后面如果追求全成就的话非常痛苦",
    "review_ids": [
      "238299391"
    ],
    "source_languages": [
      "schinese"
    ],
    "lexical_categories_diagnostic": [
      "content_support"
    ],
    "cosine_to_center": 0.8557421565055847
  },
  {
    "cluster": 3,
    "rank": 1,
    "unit_id": "S941f5b7d63165f36bb48",
    "text": "剧情挺好，作为一款剧情向游戏自由度也挺高，有的地方挺有感染力的",
    "review_ids": [
      "235839791"
    ],
    "source_languages": [
      "schinese"
    ],
    "lexical_categories_diagnostic": [
      "story_characters"
    ],
    "cosine_to_center": 0.8742037415504456
  },
  {
    "cluster": 3,
    "rank": 2,
    "unit_id": "S27b16488b94dde441882",
    "text": "我很喜欢的一个游戏，不管是背景还是剧情还是玩法我都很喜欢",
    "review_ids": [
      "239013172"
    ],
    "source_languages": [
      "schinese"
    ],
    "lexical_categories_diagnostic": [
      "story_characters"
    ],
    "cosine_to_center": 0.8714709281921387
  },
  {
    "cluster": 3,
    "rank": 3,
    "unit_id": "Sb63bda8235d0a732c04d",
    "text": "剧情和武器方面都很强，体验不错，",
    "review_ids": [
      "238998076"
    ],
    "source_languages": [
      "schinese"
    ],
    "lexical_categories_diagnostic": [
      "story_characters"
    ],
    "cosine_to_center": 0.8709596991539001
  },
  {
    "cluster": 3,
    "rank": 4,
    "unit_id": "S57339175cf3c8935ef1c",
    "text": "游戏的玩法与关卡设计确实精彩，总能在熟悉一种机制之后，又带来新的机制和玩法",
    "review_ids": [
      "238703391"
    ],
    "source_languages": [
      "schinese"
    ],
    "lexical_categories_diagnostic": [
      "gameplay"
    ],
    "cosine_to_center": 0.8675497174263
  },
  {
    "cluster": 3,
    "rank": 5,
    "unit_id": "S6ff4f7c97ff975c50c33",
    "text": "可玩性挺高，游戏画面和音乐都不错",
    "review_ids": [
      "237606556"
    ],
    "source_languages": [
      "schinese"
    ],
    "lexical_categories_diagnostic": [
      "audiovisual"
    ],
    "cosine_to_center": 0.8635517358779907
  },
  {
    "cluster": 3,
    "rank": 6,
    "unit_id": "S149337e7f2e7303eeb98",
    "text": "好玩,游戏体验非常充实,新世代玩家多花点时间也能上手,唯一缺点就是一玩天色就变",
    "review_ids": [
      "236141939"
    ],
    "source_languages": [
      "schinese"
    ],
    "lexical_categories_diagnostic": [
      "controls_difficulty"
    ],
    "cosine_to_center": 0.8615913391113281
  },
  {
    "cluster": 3,
    "rank": 7,
    "unit_id": "Safcc0c72dea9f357c489",
    "text": "太好玩了，比现在某些“3A”游戏的互动反馈还有物理引擎好多了，还有超级清晰的指引以及有趣的玩法，剧情也是很好的",
    "review_ids": [
      "237119034"
    ],
    "source_languages": [
      "schinese"
    ],
    "lexical_categories_diagnostic": [
      "story_characters"
    ],
    "cosine_to_center": 0.8603541254997253
  },
  {
    "cluster": 3,
    "rank": 8,
    "unit_id": "S702f4892618634d0aa06",
    "text": "我觉得特别好玩，尤其是你玩多了之后会连招的成就感，真心爱玩",
    "review_ids": [
      "238754814"
    ],
    "source_languages": [
      "schinese"
    ],
    "lexical_categories_diagnostic": [
      "content_support"
    ],
    "cosine_to_center": 0.8598750829696655
  },
